{
 "cues": [
  {
   "idx": 1,
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.2,
   "text": "Let me share a simple message tip for iPhone users.",
   "real_start": 0.22,
   "real_end": 3.34
  },
  {
   "idx": 2,
   "start": 4.2,
   "end": 6.8,
   "text": "It\u2019s really useful, do give it a try.",
   "real_start": 3.6,
   "real_end": 6.0
  },
  {
   "idx": 3,
   "start": 6.8,
   "end": 11.5,
   "text": "To get more helpful videos like this, subscribe to the channel right away and stay tuned.",
   "real_start": 6.34,
   "real_end": 10.34
  },
  {
   "idx": 4,
   "start": 11.5,
   "end": 14.2,
   "text": "I will keep uploading great content.",
   "real_start": 10.78,
   "real_end": 12.36
  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "start": 14.2,
   "end": 17.2,
   "text": "Now, let's see how it works. Open the Messages app on your phone.",
   "real_start": 12.84,
   "real_end": 16.2
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "start": 17.2,
   "end": 23.5,
   "text": "Select the contact you want to message, and you can send invisible messages just like this.",
   "real_start": 16.2,
   "real_end": 22.4
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "start": 23.5,
   "end": 27.5,
   "text": "They will receive it the same way, hidden until they scratch over it to read.",
   "real_start": 22.58,
   "real_end": 30.2
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "start": 27.5,
   "end": 30.0,
   "text": "It is a very simple and handy tip.",
   "real_start": 30.44,
   "real_end": 33.55
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "start": 30.0,
   "end": 34.5,
   "text": "Here's how to do it: select the contact and type your message.",
   "real_start": 33.55,
   "real_end": 42.36
  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "start": 34.5,
   "end": 39.0,
   "text": "Instead of tapping the send button, long-press on it.",
   "real_start": 42.5,
   "real_end": 48.38
  },
  {
   "idx": 11,
   "start": 39.0,
   "end": 43.2,
   "text": "You will see three or four effect options appear.",
   "real_start": 48.56,
   "real_end": 51.575
  },
  {
   "idx": 12,
   "start": 43.2,
   "end": 46.8,
   "text": "You can use any of them\u2014I'll cover the invisible effect at the end.",
   "real_start": 51.645,
   "real_end": 57.485
  },
  {
   "idx": 13,
   "start": 46.8,
   "end": 52.5,
   "text": "The first option at the top is \"Slam.\" If you select Slam and hit send, it delivers with a slam effect.",
   "real_start": 57.535,
   "real_end": 64.7
  },
  {
   "idx": 14,
   "start": 52.5,
   "end": 58.0,
   "text": "If you pick the second option, \"Loud,\" it sends with an animated notification effect.",
   "real_start": 64.7,
   "real_end": 71.47
  },
  {
   "idx": 15,
   "start": 58.0,
   "end": 62.0,
   "text": "The third option applies another subtle visual effect.",
   "real_start": 71.53,
   "real_end": 77.28
  },
  {
   "idx": 16,
   "start": 62.0,
   "end": 67.0,
   "text": "The fourth one is \"Invisible Ink,\" which we talked about earlier.",
   "real_start": 77.42,
   "real_end": 84.0
  },
  {
   "idx": 17,
   "start": 67.0,
   "end": 70.2,
   "text": "Select \"Send with Invisible Ink\" and tap Send.",
   "real_start": 84.0,
   "real_end": 90.7
  },
  {
   "idx": 18,
   "start": 70.2,
   "end": 75.0,
   "text": "The recipient receives the message hidden under a digital scratch layer.",
   "real_start": 90.94,
   "real_end": 95.64
  },
  {
   "idx": 19,
   "start": 75.0,
   "end": 78.5,
   "text": "They can simply swipe or scratch over the bubble to read it.",
   "real_start": 95.76,
   "real_end": 100.66
  },
  {
   "idx": 20,
   "start": 78.5,
   "end": 81.5,
   "text": "Isn't that a neat trick?",
   "real_start": 101.06,
   "real_end": 102.52
  },
  {
   "idx": 21,
   "start": 81.5,
   "end": 84.8,
   "text": "Follow along for more useful tips like this!",
   "real_start": 102.6,
   "real_end": 104.48
  },
  {
   "idx": 22,
   "start": 84.8,
   "end": 88.5,
   "text": "Share this video with others so more people learn about these features.",
   "real_start": 104.58,
   "real_end": 109.64
  },
  {
   "idx": 23,
   "start": 88.5,
   "end": 92.0,
   "text": "See you again soon with another new topic!",
   "real_start": 110.26,
   "real_end": 112.12
  }
 ],
